[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898183565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106411#issuecomment-2898183565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106411","id":2898183565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6svsWN","user":{"login":"SpockBauru","id":67930504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTMwNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67930504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru","html_url":"https://github.com/SpockBauru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T14:30:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T14:30:23Z","body":"While scratching my head on why ReflectionProbes must have inverted logic on` _instance_unpair` otherwise the Reflection Mask will not work, I made a picture to help understand the point of view of one Light instance and one Reflection Probe instance. \r\n\r\n![pairing_pov](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eab6a1dc-2b45-48ce-8845-a72b912f6de0)\r\n\r\n\r\nAs you can see in the picture, the Reflection Probes have 3 types of masks instead of 2. The logic for the Cull Mask and Layer Mask is the same as the others, but the logic for the Reflection Mask is reversed! That’s why it does not work like the others!\r\n\r\nI hope this picture idea also helps others to follow the logic of the pairing system.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898183565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898485474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106411#issuecomment-2898485474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106411","id":2898485474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sw2Di","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T16:00:47Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T16:00:47Z","body":"You are forgetting that lights also have three types of mask:\r\n1. Layer mask (light to camera)\r\n2. Light mask (what meshes are affected by the light)\r\n3. shadow mask (what objects cast shadows) (equivalent to reflection mask)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898485474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898698268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106411#issuecomment-2898698268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106411","id":2898698268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sxqAc","user":{"login":"SpockBauru","id":67930504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTMwNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67930504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru","html_url":"https://github.com/SpockBauru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T17:19:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T17:32:55Z","body":"You are absolutely right! I forgot about the shadow mask, it really works like the reflection mask.\r\n\r\nIt seems that the `shadow_caster_mask` is not handled by the pairing system, but by `_light_instance_update_shadow` and `_light_instance_setup_directional_shadow`.\r\n\r\nShould we move the `reflection_mask` handling to another place? Personally, I prefer to handle in the pairing system, but I'm open for suggestions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898698268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2910246950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106411#issuecomment-2910246950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106411","id":2910246950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tdtgm","user":{"login":"SpockBauru","id":67930504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTMwNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67930504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru","html_url":"https://github.com/SpockBauru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T16:41:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T17:09:51Z","body":"With further investigation and several tests, I’m convinced that Reflection Mask, indeed, does not behave like the other pairing instances.\r\n\r\nLights have the Shadow Caster Mask which behaves similarly, but they are paired with the Geometry flag \"Cast Shadows\" and the pairing system just set shadows as “dirty”.  The mask logic is handled on specialized functions like `_light_instance_update_shadow `and `_light_instance_setup_directional_shadow`.\r\n\r\nThe Reflection Mask is different: it does not have a flag in geometry instances and the specialized functions work differently. After considering some alternative approaches, the pairing system is still the most effective place to handle the Reflection Mask.\r\n\r\nAfter several tests and recompilations, I’m pushing the best behavior that I found for the reflection mask. It does not check every frame and does not let the reflection paired with disabled geometry (like the last implementation).\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2910246950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2916629769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106411#issuecomment-2916629769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106411","id":2916629769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t2D0J","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T14:48:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T14:48:30Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2916629769/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]